 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Dar",
     "texto": [
      "**dar com** (to come across): **Dei com a chave** (I came across the key). **dar por** (to consider): **Dou-o por perdido** (I consider it lost). To notice that something is missing, in European Portuguese it is very natural to use **dar pela falta de**: **Dei pela falta do livro** (I noticed the book was missing). **dar por falta de** is also found."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Ficar",
     "texto": [
      "**ficar com** (to keep): **Fico com o carro** (I'll keep the car). **ficar por** (to be left to do something): **Ficou por fazer** (it was left undone)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Passar",
     "texto": [
      "**passar por** (to pass through a place or to seem): **Passei pela loja** (I went past the shop). **passar a** + infinitive (to start to): **Passei a trabalhar aqui** (I started to work here). **passar de** (to exceed): **Passou dos cinquenta** (he / she is over fifty)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
